	kgmTrCoordReturnPhaseId02 OBJECT-TYPE
		SYNTAX                INTEGER (0..255)
		ACCESS                read-write
		STATUS                mandatory
		DESCRIPTION "<Definition> Yesil dalga donus fazi numarasi. Uygulanan 2. yesil dalga
